{"id": "1358067913105473557", "ts": "2025-04-05T13:17:02.166000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "214670718669946882", "name": "probi", "global_name": "Delman", "bot": false}, "content": "# 🐛 How to Report Bugs Correctly\n\n**How to report bugs correctly using Phone/Emulator bots?**\n\nZip this folder and send it here via Tickets on Discord.\n\nBot folder -> phone/emulator folder -> crash_log (full folder) \n\nIt will make our lives easier, and we can fix issues faster.", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
{"id": "1358067855865675887", "ts": "2025-04-05T13:16:48.519000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "214670718669946882", "name": "probi", "global_name": "Delman", "bot": false}, "content": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1358043801347821830/1358067855555301419/line_white.png?ex=69daf280&is=69d9a100&hm=fe1949a013483d049f4117e09aa5db38643ebfc816ed6be0927060b10ee8eed7&", "filename": "line_white.png", "size": 7614}], "embeds": [], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
{"id": "1358067823448035399", "ts": "2025-04-05T13:16:40.790000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "214670718669946882", "name": "probi", "global_name": "Delman", "bot": false}, "content": "# ⚙️ Copying Settings Between Accounts\n\n**How to copy settings at Bumble and Tinder bot.**\n\nHere is a simple explanation of how to copy the settings of the account to another one (it will copy all settings).\n\n1. Open bot folder\n2. Open the device folder\n3. Open Bumble/Tinder folder\n4. Open the account folder (this is where you have set up settings)\n5. Copy files: **Settings.db** and **Messages.db**\n6. Paste into newly added accounts\n\n**PRO TIP:**\n\nat sent_message.db you can check your chat history\n\nTo open DB files, you will need to install SQL DB Reader Lite, and open database using SQL DB Reader\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1184036661340950598/1207681599521685564/image.png?ex=67efe022&is=67ee8ea2&hm=5d478ef347d12aee579fa29d24e3dd541bede40453db9d9b8af847e89bc59b62&", "attachments": [], "embeds": [{"title": null, "description": null, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1184036661340950598/1207681599521685564/image.png?ex=67efe022&is=67ee8ea2&hm=5d478ef347d12aee579fa29d24e3dd541bede40453db9d9b8af847e89bc59b62&"}], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
