{"id": "1358067620921737316", "ts": "2025-04-05T13:15:52.504000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "214670718669946882", "name": "probi", "global_name": "Delman", "bot": false}, "content": "# 🔒 Permanently Disable Real-Time Protection\n\n**How to permanently turn off Real-Time protection.**\n\nMost of the issues come from database problems and Windows security. We need to turn this off to be able to overwrite the current database inside your bot folder.\n\nPlease take a look at this tutorial: \n\nhttps://chat.openai.com/share/972fb6ae-2aa3-4342-b07d-1369dc566e6e", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
