{"id": "1358067453862613163", "ts": "2025-04-05T13:15:12.674000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "214670718669946882", "name": "probi", "global_name": "Delman", "bot": false}, "content": "# 🔧 Fixing Database Crashes\n\n**First IG username or Device ID is crashing your database files. You need to open that folder (open them using SQL DB reader), and depends if that's device, or account - open bot folder and open device.db, then remove that device from list. If that's account issue, open bot folder > phone folder > account.db, and remove problematic account from list**\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1184036661340950598/1198997154367283291/image.png?ex=67efec1d&is=67ee9a9d&hm=e2360ce5260f54532f48b379feaa2b4f40fe63df7f14ba57298899a53363c04e&", "attachments": [], "embeds": [{"title": null, "description": null, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1184036661340950598/1198997154367283291/image.png?ex=67efec1d&is=67ee9a9d&hm=e2360ce5260f54532f48b379feaa2b4f40fe63df7f14ba57298899a53363c04e&"}], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
